  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Bring a medium saucepan of salted water to the boil.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the milk and half the butter to the potato, then season with salt. Mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd23b48b4d4424a2089905-ca1e6cd7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic and brown onion. Trim green beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd23b48b4d4424a2089905-df06607a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook green beans until tender, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Season with salt and pepper, transfer to a bowl and cover to keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd23b48b4d4424a2089905-b786060a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Wipe out the frying pan, then return to high heat with a generous drizzle of olive oil. Cook plant-based crumbed chicken with sliced mushrooms, until golden and heated through, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add onion and cook until tender, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd23b48b4d4424a2089905-a9714361.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add tomato paste, garlic & herb seasoning, remaining garlic and remaining butter and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add light cooking cream, vegetable stock powder, Dijon mustard and the water and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd23b48b4d4424a2089905-cddb148a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide mashed potato between bowls.\n• Top with plant-based crumbed chicken and mushroom stroganoff.\n• Serve with garlicky greens. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67bd23b48b4d4424a2089905-a744b396.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
